  "result": "Fixed! The vulnerability was in the `findIssueById` function in `/src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. It was querying for issues by ID only, without checking if the issue belonged to the specified organization. \n\nThe fix adds the `orgPredicate` check to ensure that `findIssueById` validates organization scope, matching the pattern already used in `findIssueByNumber`. Now when a user from one organization tries to access an issue ID from a different organization, the database query will return `null` instead of serving the issue, preventing the cross-organization access vulnerability.",
